  "content": "\n\n# 擴展武器附魔\n\n**此數據包與模組**擴充了武器附魔，使其包含穿刺、密度、穿透與風爆。它還允許在同一把武器上混合不同類別的武器附魔。\n\n**‎◾範例：**\n\n![擴展武器附魔](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff2fe7a7ba62d1c23f82a2d31e56a18907672408.jpeg)\n\n![擴展武器附魔](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/660f863ee0933dd0eab5e88e5a7ed7e656120b21.jpeg)\n\n![擴展武器附魔](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5188edbfd0fb143ab38924380f93446ac1413833.jpeg)\n\n\n## 詳細資訊📝\n\n- **擴展武器附魔**與版本 **1.21 至 1.21.11** **相容**\n- **擴展武器附魔**為附魔台新增了 **(擴充)** 選項🌐\n- **擴展武器附魔**與任何 **附魔數據包** 均相容\n- **無需**對下載的檔案進行 **解壓縮** 🗂️\n\n## 更多專案：\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (43)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (44)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Trident Enchants Logo\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Mace Enchants Logo (2)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (47)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (48)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (49)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif